---
/* Substack post by the example creator sarah, composed in design/posts (see scripts/render-posts.py for its media).
   Drawn at 400x640 design pixels; Post.astro scales it to fit. Fictional, labeled as an example where it's shown. */
---

<div class="root" aria-hidden="true">
<div class="pub"><span class="logo">T&amp;E</span><b>Trial &amp; Error</b><span class="sp"></span><span class="sub">Subscribe</span></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>The one email that doubled my trial-to-paid</h1>
    <h2>I watched 1,140 trials stall. It was never where I guessed.</h2>
    <div class="by"><span class="av"></span><span><b>Sarah K.</b><span>Oct 14, 2026</span></span></div>
    <div class="acts">
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-8.8-8.6C1.9 8.3 3.9 5 7.2 5c1.9 0 3.3 1 4.8 2.8C13.5 6 14.9 5 16.8 5c3.3 0 5.3 3.3 4 6.4C19 15.6 12 20 12 20z"/></svg>214</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1.1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/></svg>37</span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 9h13l-3-3M20 15H7l3 3"/></svg>12</span>
      <span class="sp"></span>
      <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12M7 8l5-5 5 5M5 14v5h14v-5"/></svg>Share</span>
    </div>
    <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="hero" src="/assets/posts/sarah.jpg" alt="">
    <p>Last spring, 1 in 11 of my trials paid. This month it was 1 in 5, with the same product.</p>
    <p>I found it with <a>Fernwood</a> (affiliate link: I earn a commission if you subscribe, at no cost to you). Its 30-day trial is long enough to run this whole teardown on your own funnel.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="fade"></div>
</div>

<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.root {
  position: relative;
  width: 400px;
  height: 640px;
 font-family: -apple-system, 'SF Pro Text', system-ui, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; overflow: hidden; }
svg { display: block; }

/* iOS status bar, light or dark */
.sb { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 46px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 26px 0 34px; font: 600 15px/1 -apple-system, system-ui; z-index: 50; }
.sb.dark { color: #fff; }
.sb.light { color: #000; }
.sb .r { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
.sb .bars { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 1.5px; height: 11px; }
.sb .bars i { width: 3px; border-radius: 1px; background: currentColor; }
.sb .bars i:nth-child(1) { height: 4px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(2) { height: 6px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(3) { height: 8.5px; } .sb .bars i:nth-child(4) { height: 11px; }
.sb .bars i.off { opacity: 0.35; }
.sb .batt { position: relative; width: 25px; height: 12px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid currentColor; opacity: 0.9; padding: 1.5px; }
.sb .batt::after { content: ''; position: absolute; right: -3.5px; top: 3.5px; width: 2px; height: 4px; border-radius: 0 1px 1px 0; background: currentColor; opacity: 0.5; }
.sb .batt b { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: currentColor; }
.sb .batt.low b { background: #ffd60a; }


  /* A Substack post, as it opens on the web */
  .root { width: 400px; height: 640px; background: #fff; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .pub { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  .pub .logo { width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px; background: #e8613c; color: #fff; display: grid; place-items: center; font: 700 11px/1 ui-serif, Georgia, serif; }
  .pub b { font: 700 15px/1 ui-serif, Georgia, serif; }
  .pub .sp { flex: 1; }
  .pub .sub { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; background: #e8613c; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 7px; }
  .wrap { padding: 18px 18px 0; }
  h1 { font: 700 25px/1.18 ui-serif, Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  h2 { font: 400 15.5px/1.4 ui-serif, Georgia, serif; color: #6b6b6b; margin-top: 8px; }
  .by { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  .av { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: url(/assets/posts/avatars/sarah.jpg) center / cover; }
  .by b { display: block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .by span { font-size: 12px; color: #777; }
  .acts { display: none; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding: 9px 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  .acts span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #555; padding: 4px 9px; border: 1px solid #e6e6e6; border-radius: 999px; }
  .acts svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; }
  .acts .sp { flex: 1; border: 0; }
  .hero { display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 16px; border-radius: 4px; }
  p { font: 400 15.5px/1.6 ui-serif, Georgia, serif; color: #2a2a2a; margin-top: 14px; }
  p a { color: #1a1a1a; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #e8613c; text-underline-offset: 2px; font-weight: 600; }
  .fade { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 70px; background: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0), #fff); }
</style>
